<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>About | AI Resume Analyzer</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/about.css" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="about-container">
      <section class="hero">
        <h1>About AI Resume Analyzer</h1>

        <p>
          AI Resume Analyzer is an intelligent web application that helps
          students, fresh graduates, and professionals improve their resumes
          using Artificial Intelligence. The system analyzes resumes, evaluates
          their quality, and provides personalized suggestions to increase the
          chances of getting shortlisted by recruiters.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mission">
        <h2>Our Mission</h2>

        <p>
          Our mission is to simplify resume building and make professional
          resume analysis accessible to everyone. We aim to help users create
          ATS-friendly resumes that match industry standards and improve job
          opportunities.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="features">
        <h2>What Our Platform Offers</h2>

        <ul>
          <li>📄 Upload resumes in PDF or DOCX format.</li>
          <li>🤖 AI-powered resume analysis.</li>
          <li>📊 ATS (Applicant Tracking System) compatibility score.</li>
          <li>💡 Personalized suggestions for improvement.</li>
          <li>🛠️ Identification of missing technical and soft skills.</li>
          <li>📈 Resume history and previous analysis tracking.</li>
          <li>📥 Secure resume management.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="technology">
        <h2>Technologies Used</h2>

        <ul>
          <li>Node.js</li>
          <li>Express.js</li>
          <li>MongoDB & Mongoose</li>
          <li>EJS</li>
          <li>HTML, CSS & JavaScript</li>
          <li>Gemini/OpenAI API for AI-powered analysis</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="users">
        <h2>Who Can Use AI Resume Analyzer?</h2>

        <ul>
          <li>🎓 College Students</li>
          <li>👨‍💻 Software Developers</li>
          <li>💼 Job Seekers</li>
          <li>🚀 Fresh Graduates</li>
          <li>📈 Working Professionals</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="vision">
        <h2>Our Vision</h2>

        <p>
          We envision a future where every job seeker has access to intelligent
          tools that help create professional, ATS-friendly resumes, making the
          hiring process easier and more efficient.
        </p>
      </section>

      <div class="back-home">
        <a href="/">
          <button>← Back to Home</button>
        </a>
      </div>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
